    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are pleased to bring Apt. 35 Papworth Hall to the lettings market. Nestled in the corner of a new, meticulously maintained residential development, this two-bedroom apartment is within walking distance of Foxrock village and boasts direct access to Cabinteely Park. In turn key condition, the A-rated property features high-end finishes throughout, including top of the range integrated appliances, Silestone worktops custom made cabinetry, vanity units and wardrobes. Accommodation comprises a bright hallway, kitchen, open-plan dining living room leading out to a private, sun-filled balcony, utility with built-in storage, master bedroom with en suite, guest double bedroom, main bathroom and additional closed storage. Residents have access to a designated car parking space. This property is available to let immediately on a minimum 12-month lease. Viewing comes highly recommended.\r\n\r\nLocation: Brennanstown Wood was constructed in 2022 and is benefits from being within minutes of all local amenities. Along with being within walking distance of Foxrock, nearby villages also include Cabinteely, Cornelscourt, Deansgrange and Stillorgan. It is well placed when it comes to transport, with easy access to the LUAS at Carrickmines, the M50, N11 and Dublin bus routes"
      },
